Edge function secrets (Supabase dashboard):
  LIVEKIT_URL, LIVEKIT_API_KEY, LIVEKIT_API_SECRET
  TELNYX_API_KEY, TELNYX_SIP_TRUNK_ID
  SUPABASE_URL, SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY

## Rules

- Do not change database schema without flagging it first
- Always explain what was broken and why the fix works
- Flag any missing environment variables
- Preserve all existing functionality when refactoring
- QueueContact from use-dialer-queue has FLAT fields (no nested contact.* subobject)
- dialingRef.current must be reset on ALL exit paths in dial() — success stays true, failure/early-return sets false

